                "reply_count": 8,
                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "On Medicaid, contrary to Democrats\u2019 claims, this bill DOES NOT CUT Medicaid. It puts the program back on a more sustainable path, preserving it for those it was originally intended to serve. Federal Medicaid spending has tripled since 2008, and if left unaddressed it will put those who it was designed to help at risk.\n\nThis bill prevents gimmicks that Democrat states use to milk the federal government, and puts in place sensible work requirements for able bodied Americans who wish to continue receiving Medicaid benefits. All of this was done to protect those who truly need this vital program. (9/12)",
